<div class="wrap">
  <section class="ch" id="on-your-hookah"><p class="ch__num">06 · Start</p><h2>On your hookah</h2><p class="ch__lead">Diamond sits where the bowl sits. Your stem, base and hose stay as they are.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:3"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Adapter on, half-way</b><p>Push one of the two adapters onto your hookah stem, only half-way. Do not push it all the way down.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.hookah_adapter != blank -%}{{- section.settings.hookah_adapter | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.hookah_adapter.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.hookah_adapter.width, height: section.settings.hookah_adapter.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-hookah-adapter-two-hands.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Diamond on top, then press</b><p>Set Diamond on the adapter and press down with both hands: they slide down the stem together for the firmest grip.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.hookah_mount != blank -%}{{- section.settings.hookah_mount | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.hookah_mount.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.hookah_mount.width, height: section.settings.hookah_mount.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-hookah-mount-two-hands.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">3</span><b>Ready</b><p>Your hookah, hose and base stay the same. Only the bowl and the coals are gone.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">{%- if section.settings.on_hookah != blank -%}{{- section.settings.on_hookah | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.on_hookah.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.on_hookah.width, height: section.settings.on_hookah.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-on-hookah-front.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}</div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></section>
</div>

